<title>JAPAN: Fuji Spinning -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fuji Spinning -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996  (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 35.37		vs	   34.29</p>
<p> Operating   loss 606    million	  vs	 prft 26 million</p>
<p> Current     loss 132    million	  vs   loss 147    million</p>
<p> Net		 prft 17 million	  vs   loss 231    million</p>
<p> EPS	     prft 0.16 yen	  vs     loss 2.14 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    108 million	  vs	 108 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Fuji Spinning Co Ltd is a manufacturer of cotton, synthetics and wool.</p>
